<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Static-Sites on Tech Blog</title><link>https://fabion.ai/tags/static-sites/</link><description>Recent content in Static-Sites on Tech Blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 05 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://fabion.ai/tags/static-sites/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Hugo vs Other Static Site Generators: Why I Chose Hugo</title><link>https://fabion.ai/blog/2025/11/hugo-vs-other-static-site-generators-why-i-chose-hugo/</link><pubDate>Wed, 05 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://fabion.ai/blog/2025/11/hugo-vs-other-static-site-generators-why-i-chose-hugo/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;When building this blog, I evaluated several static site generators. Here&amp;rsquo;s why I ultimately chose Hugo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="the-contenders"&gt;The Contenders&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I considered these popular options:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hugo&lt;/strong&gt; - Go-based SSG&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jekyll&lt;/strong&gt; - Ruby-based, GitHub Pages default&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next.js&lt;/strong&gt; - React-based framework with SSG support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gatsby&lt;/strong&gt; - React-based SSG focused on GraphQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
