&lt;h2 id="why-hugo-won"&gt;Why Hugo Won&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id="1-speed"&gt;1. Speed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hugo is &lt;strong&gt;ridiculously fast&lt;/strong&gt;. Building thousands of pages takes seconds, not minutes:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>